flowchart TD
    A[User input: genre, mood, target_energy, likes_acoustic] --> B[load_songs: data/songs.csv]
    B --> C[score_song: for each song]
    C --> D[Scoring rules\ngenre match +1.5\nmood match +2.0\nenergy closeness up to +2.0\nacousticness alignment +/-0.5]
    D --> E[recommend_songs: rank by score, tie-break by energy diff]
